{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14029","headline":"酬张少尹秋日凤翔西郊见寄 · 耿湋","name":"酬张少尹秋日凤翔西郊见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎气孕河汾，英英济旧勳。\n刘生曾任侠，张率自能文。\n官佐征西府，名齐将上军。\n秋山遥出浦，野鹤暮离羣。\n远恨边笳起，劳歌骑吏闻。\n废关人不到，荒戍日空曛。\n草木凉初变，阴晴景半分。\n叠蝉临积水，乱燕入过云。\n丽藻终思我，衰髯亦爲君。\n闲吟寡和曲，庭叶渐纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}